        <mxCell id="accessibility" value="Owner-selected GitHub visual language: icon-only Back / read-only Refresh below cards, 20 px symbols with a 12 px gap and accessible names/tooltips. No visible titles above text-entry bars. Existing theme tokens, keyboard focus and safe async states apply; placeholders never replace accessible names. Multiple accounts and explicit selection are confirmed. Remaining implementation/provider eligibility gates stay open." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#182230;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;rounded=0;spacing=0;arcSize=8;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
