        <mxCell id="P10-update-story" value="&lt;b&gt;S08 - Confirm an unverifiable key replacement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only this update variant requires the confirmation. Verify available workspace identity first; known mismatches use P07 instead. No model turn. A successful update advances generation and requires fresh sessions; failure keeps the old committed key.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Update key stays disabled until the confirmation is checked." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;absoluteArcSize=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#d0d7de;fontColor=#182230;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
