        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="P13-story" value="&lt;b&gt;S10 / Q0-Q2 - Inspect real allowance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a user, I open a harness and see each saved account with its own explicit Refresh limits icon. Opening, changing a preference or switching tabs sends no model task.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Q0 Not checked -&gt; Q01 Refresh -&gt; Q1 Checking -&gt; Q02 Read succeeds -&gt; Q2 Current.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Each provider-reported bucket can contain primary and secondary windows; absent fields remain unknown. Labels/durations/reset times shown here are illustrative, not fixed plan tiers. Credit balance stays separate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Q03 Another account/graph/harness: clear the pending view and ignore its late result. Preserve graph-scoped preferences.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bars show remaining allowance. Fresh Refresh reuses its snapshot; failed reads have a10second retry cooldown. Native single-flight is per account generation, while cache visibility is per lease." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#d9dee7;fontColor=#263547;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="710" y="6350" width="440" height="530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
