        <mxCell id="P15-credit-states" value="Unlimited credits / No credits / Credit balance unknown" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#f4f4f5;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontSize=12;fontColor=#a1a1aa;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="7980" width="560" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="P15-story" value="&lt;b&gt;S10 / Q2 - Multiple buckets and partial fields&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bucket order: ascending native ID. Label: reported display name, otherwise ID. Native primary/secondary windows stay separate; the Review example has only secondary.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every known percentage has the same remaining-allowance bar. Invalid scalar fields become unknown locally; malformed response structure fails the read. Unknown percentages have no bar. Empty reported buckets: No limits reported.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Credits are independent: Credit balance followed by reported value (no invented currency), Unlimited credits, No credits, or Credit balance unknown. Absent credits: no line.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Values are illustrative. No fixed product windows or priorities." style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8fafc;strokeColor=#d9dee7;fontColor=#263547;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="710" y="7580" width="440" height="470" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="P16-card" value="" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#19191c;strokeColor=#34343a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
